  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Displacement Monitoring Centre (IDMC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDMC&apos;s overall objective is to effect positive change on internal displacement and ensure internally displaced people are protected worldwide. This is done through the provision of global data and analysis on internal displcement and enhanced capacity and commitments by local, national and international actors to prevent and and respond to interrnal displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
